  "Object.Cursed-Coriander-Doll.Description": "Manufactured with love adjacent material in a Joja Co. factory. It's coming apart at the seams.\n\nWarning: Joja is not liable for any supernatural occurrences associated with Cirrus Cloud(TM) Branded Cirrus Dolls.",
