  "Object.Cirrus-Branded-Toothbrush.Name": "Cirrus Cloud(TM) Branded Toothbrush",
  "Object.Cirrus-Branded-Toothbrush.Description": "Brush your teeth just like Cirrus with this Limited Edition Cirrus Cloud(TM) brand toothbrush. Made from only the finest grade Joja Co. plastic.\n\nWarning: Cirrus Cloud(TM) Branded Toothpaste not included. Must be purchased separately. Joja Co. is not liable for any enamel damaged associated with use of this tooth brush.",
  // ARTIFACTS 
  "Object.Progenitor-Rex.Name": "Progenitor Rex",
  "Object.Progenitor-Rex.Description": "This figurine proves that, yes, Pepper Rexes have in fact always looked that dopey. It would be reasonable to hypothesize that the cuteness is a survival tactic.",
  "Object.Pith-Helmet.Name": "Pith Helmet",
  "Object.Pith-Helmet.Description": "A hat belonging to adventurer Linden Hawthorn - otherwise known as the Prairie King. Linden was known far and wide for being kind and encouraging to those he met.",
  "Object.Canary-Resuscitator.Name": "Canary Resuscitator",
  "Object.Canary-Resuscitator.Description": "An aluminum cage with an oxygen tank that would house a canary while inside the mines. The canary could detect dangerous gasses before humans could, and this contraption would preserve the canary's life.",
  "Object.Hook-Hand.Name": "Hook Hand",
  "Object.Hook-Hand.Description": "Text is carved delicately into the curved metal, reading:\n\n'Death is the only great adventure I have left.'",
  "Object.Theodolite.Name": "Theodolite",
  "Object.Theodolite.Description": "An unusual instrument used for measuring angles between horizontal and vertical planes. Found in East Scarp, it was likely used for mapping out cave systems.",
  "Object.Pottery-Hen.Name": "Pottery Hen",
  "Object.Pottery-Hen.Description": "Hand-painted porcelain; rumor has it that they mysteriously appear in the kitchens of anyone who becomes a grandparent.",
  "Object.Sextant.Name": "Sextant",
  "Object.Sextant.Description": "A tool used by sailors to deduct a vessel's latitude and longitude by measure the distance between a celestial body and the horizon line.",
  "Object.Whale-Tooth-Scrimshaw.Name": "Whale Tooth Scrimshaw",
  "Object.Whale-Tooth-Scrimshaw.Description": "A bone from a mighty beast, preserved and used as a canvas for whittled artwork of a majestic sailboat.",
  "Object.Sailmaking-Tool.Name": "Sailmaking Tool",
  "Object.Sailmaking-Tool.Description": "Worn around the palm, made of leather and accented with a dimpled brass stud used to push the head of a needle through heavy cloth.",
  "Object.Dynamite-Detonator.Name": "Dynamite Detonator",
  "Object.Dynamite-Detonator.Description": "This antique plunger box was rigged to many sticks of dynamite back in the day, and is likely the cause of the Deep Dark's winding tunnels.",
